WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start here explains each step and gives you
a 3D example you can play without an arm.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
USB connection. Choose your follower and Scan ports.
For a calibrated arm, select Connect by USB.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Calibration. Choose Calibrate new to capture
the midpoint and usable range by hand.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.500
To reuse the same arm’s file, assign it in Settings,
then choose Restore saved calibration.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Simulation. Write a route in the Python editor.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Select Preview in 3D to check the motion.
Gold highlights show the active motors.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.300
Deployment. With a calibrated arm connected, prepare
the route, review every target, and confirm once.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.400
Settings. Manage follower profiles
and import or save calibration files.
